LOGICAL OPERATORS:

Logical operator is used to compare more than two condition ( if we want to compare only wo values means we will use relational operator)

&& (Logical AND ):
    if any one of the condition is false means , result will be false

|| (Logical OR):
    if any one of the condition is true means, result will be true


! (Logical NOT):
    if the condition is true means , result wil be false.
    if the condition is falsse means, result will be true.


PROGRAM:

